cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Developmental origins of NK cells: TCR footprints and mtDNA lineage tracing"
message: "If you use this analysis or the mtclone package, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Corvino
    given-names: Dillon
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0683-1369"
    website: "https://dilloncorvino.com"
abstract: >-
  Tests whether NK cells carry a TCR-rearrangement footprint of a thymic or aborted-T origin and
  whether CD56bright and CD56dim NK cells are distinct lineages, using single-cell VDJ data and
  somatic mtDNA lineage tracing across public datasets. Includes mtclone, a tested package for
  mtDNA clone calling and sharing statistics.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Eomesodermin/Thymic_NK_development"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - NK cells
  - lineage tracing
  - mtDNA
  - single-cell
  - TCR
